l spares and labor.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-10\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Annual Maintenance Contract AC Repair Vadodara\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-lg\" title=\"\">\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"font-bold text-2xl mb-4\">Why Atlas Aircon for your AMC?</h3>\n                <p>We provide a 100% human-centric service approach. Our technicians are trained to handle <b>HVAC repair services Vadodara</b> for both residential and heavy industrial units. By opting for our <b>Annual Maintenance Contract</b>, you ensure a longer life for your machines and lower electricity bills.</p>\n                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2\">\n                    <li>Priority service for AMC customers in <b>Vadodara</b>.</li>\n                    <li>Genuine spares at wholesale prices.</li>\n                    <li>Regular preventive maintenance visits.</li>\n                    <li>Expertise in <b>central AC repair services Vadodara</b>.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-xl my-12 border border-gray-200\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Pros and Cons of Annual Maintenance Contract</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n            <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-4\">Pros of Atlas Aircon AMC</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <li><b>Fixed Budgeting:</b> No surprise repair costs during the year.</li>\n                    <li><b>Longevity:</b> Regular servicing extends machine life significantly.</li>\n                    <li><b>Energy Efficiency:</b> Clean units consume less power.</li>\n                    <li><b>Priority Support:</b> Faster response times in peak summer.</li>\n                    <li><b>Expert Documentation:</b> Detailed service reports for industrial audits.</li>\n                    <li><b>Safety:</b> Prevents electrical hazards and gas leaks.</li>\n                    <li><b>Genuine Spares:</b> Access to quality components for all brands.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-red-500\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-700 mb-4\">Cons of Not Having AMC</h3>\n                <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                    <li><b>Higher Emergency Costs:</b> Urgent repairs are always expensive.</li>\n                    <li><b>Unpredictable Breakdowns:</b> Units fail when you need them most.</li>\n                    <li><b>Poor Air Quality:</b> Dirty filters lead to health issues.</li>\n                    <li><b>Warranty Void Risks:</b> Lack of service can void manufacturer terms.</li>\n                    <li><b>Increased Bills:</b> Struggling units draw more current.</li>\n                    <li><b>No Priority:</b> Waiting days for a technician in April/May.</li>\n                    <li><b>Shortened Life:</b> Frequent friction wears out compressors faster.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands Section -->\n    <section class=\"my-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Which Brands We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-8\">We offer specialized <b>Annual Maintenance Contract</b> support for a wide array of global brands. We are independent experts providing high-quality service for:</p>\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4 brand-grid text-center font-bold\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Daikin</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/voltas-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Voltas</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/samsung-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Samsung</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/lg-ac-service-center-vadodara\">LG</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Blue Star</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Carrier</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/hitachi-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Hitachi</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/mitsubishi-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Mitsubishi</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/o-general-ac-service-center-vadodara\">O General</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/panasonic-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Panasonic</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/york-ac-service-center-vadodara\">York</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/haier-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Haier</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/onida-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Onida</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/electrolux-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Electrolux</a></div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md\"><a href=\"/kelvinator-ac-service-center-vadodara\">Kelvinator</a></div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Services Section -->\n    <section class=\"my-16 bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-xl\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Which Types We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded shadow\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-blue-600\">Residential Solutions</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Keep your home cool with our AMC for split and window units.</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-xs space-y-1\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/split-ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Split AC Service</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/window-ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Window AC Service</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Refrigerator Repair</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Air Cooler Repair</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded shadow\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-blue-600\">Commercial HVAC</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm mb-4\">Complete maintenance for offices, malls, and shops.</p>\n                <ul class=\"text-xs space-y-1\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/cassette-ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Cassette AC AMC</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/ductable-ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Ductable AC Service</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Central AC Systems</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 hover:underline\">Water Cooler Maintenance</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded shadow\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-blue-600\">Industrial &#038; Cold Chain</h4>\n  