leaning + Gas Check</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600\">Buy Now</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">Cassette / Ductable</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">₹3,500 &#8211; ₹6,000</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">Full System Diagnostic</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600\">Buy Now</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">Deep Freezer / Refrigerator</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">₹2,000 &#8211; ₹4,500</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\">Compressor &#038; Coil Check</td>\n                        <td class=\"p-4\"><a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600\">Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- GIDC & Industrial Area Focus -->\n    <section class=\"my-16 bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-2xl\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Specialized Industrial &#038; GIDC AMC Services</h2>\n        <p class=\"mb-8\">We understand that industrial downtime leads to massive financial losses. Atlas Aircon offers express <b>Annual Maintenance Contract</b> services for GIDC areas. We specialize in <b>panel AC service Vadodara</b> and <b>ducting repair services Vadodara</b> for pharmaceutical, chemical, and engineering plants.</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-400\">Major GIDC Areas Covered:</h4>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Makarpura GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Nandesari GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Waghodia GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Por GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Savli GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Halol GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Manjusar GIDC</span>\n                    <span class=\"gidc-badge\">Ranoli GIDC</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-400\">Industrial Parks:</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-sm\">We provide onsite support at <b>Kotambi Industrial Park</b>, <b>Nexus Industrial Park</b>, <b>Fortune Industrial Park</b>, and the <b>Petrochemical Complex Area</b>. Our technicians are equipped with safety gear and certifications required for industrial premises.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Error Codes Section -->\n    <section class=\"my-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Common AC Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 bg-gray-50\">\n                <b>E1/E2 Error:</b> Sensor failure or room temperature sensor fault. <i>Solution: Replace thermistor.</i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 bg-gray-50\">\n                <b>F1/F2 Error:</b> Communication error between indoor and outdoor unit. <i>Solution: Check signal wiring.</i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 bg-gray-50\">\n                <b>H6 Error:</b> Indoor fan motor block. <i>Solution: Check for dust accumulation or motor failure.</i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 border-l-4 border-yellow-500 bg-gray-50\">\n                <b>P4 Error:</b> Inverter compressor drive error. <i>Solution: Check PCB board voltage.</i>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Areas Served Section -->\n    <section class=\"my-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Areas We Serve in Vadodara &#038; Beyond</h2>\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-lg text-xs leading-relaxed\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-2\">Residential Areas:</h4>\n            Alkapuri | Akota | Sayajigunj | Raopura | Mandvi | Nyay Mandir | Lehripura | Panigate | Wadi | Fatehpura | Yakutpura | Nagarwada | Dandia Bazar | Khanderao Market | Pratapgunj | Fatehgunj | Nizampura | Chhani | Chhani Jakat Naka | Sama | Sama-Savli Road | Vemali | Karelibaug | Warasiya | Harni | Harni-Warasia Ring Road | Motnath Mahadev | Vip Road | New Vip Road | Ajwa Road | Waghodia Road | Bapod | Bakrawadi | Kishanwadi | Soma Talav | Tarsali | Kapurai | Makarpura | Makarpura GIDC | Maneja | Manjalpur | Jambuva | Vadsar | Susen | Dhamalpur | Por | Ramangamdi | Atladara | Kalali | Bill | Sun Pharma Road | Old Padra Road | Chakli Circle | Diwalipura | Vasna Road | Vasna-Bhayli Road | Bhayli | Sevasi | Gotri | Gotri-Sevasi Road | Subhanpura | Ellora Park | Race Course | Gorwa | Laxmipura | Undera | Ankhol | Sherkhi | Koyali | Bajwa | Karachiya | Refinery Road | Ranoli | Nandesari | Nandesari GIDC | Fajalpur | Sindhrot | Ampad | Mahapura | Khatamba | Sayajipura | Ankodiya | Khanpur | Tandalja | Jetalpur | Danteshwar | Lalbaug | Pratap Nagar | Vishwamitri | Mujmahuda | Akota-Dandia Bazar Bridge Area | Ghadiyali Pole | Chokshi Bazar | Moghul Wada | Baranpura | Nawapura | Madan Zampa | Salatwada | Kothi Kacheri | Jail Road | Bhutidizampa | Hathikhana | Ghadiyali Pole | Raopura Tower | Jubelibaug | Amdupura | Bhayli Station Area | Bil-Chapad Road | Sama Puliya | Abhilasha Char Rasta | Amit Nagar | Sangam Char Rasta | Panigate Darwaza | Gajrawadi | Ramwadi | Yamuna Mill | Dhabhoi Road | Pratapnagar | Chowkhandi | Kansara Pol | Laheripura New Road | Ratanpol | Sursagar | Kirti Stambh | Rajmahal Road | Lalbaug Bridge | Vishwamitri Station Area.\n            \n            <h4 class=\"font-bold mt-4 mb-2\">Industrial Zones:</h4>\n            Makarpura GIDC | Nandesari GIDC | Waghodia GIDC | Por GIDC | Ramangamdi GIDC | Savli GIDC | Manjusar GIDC | Ranoli GIDC | Sardar Industrial Estate | Gorwa BIDC | Gorwa Industrial Area | Bapod Industrial Area | Yamuna Mill Industrial Area | Chhani Industrial Area | Petrochemical Complex (IPCL/PCC) Area | Koyali Refinery Area | Kotambi Industrial Park | Jarod Industrial Area | Samlaya Industrial Area | Tundav Industrial Area | Lamdapura Industrial Area | Muval Industrial Area | Desar Industrial Area | Sanvadodara GIDC | Dabhoi GIDC | Pavi-Jetpur GIDC | Bodeli Industrial Area | Padra Industrial Area | Ekalbara Industrial Area | Jambusar Road Industrial Zone | Atladra Industrial Area | Sokhada Industrial Area | Dashrath Industrial Estate | Bajwa Industrial Area | Karjan Industrial Area | Miyagam Karjan GIDC | Vadsar Industrial Area | Maneja Industrial Area | Maretha Industrial Zone | Nexus Industrial Park | Shah Industrial Park | Brushellz Industrial Park | Avani Industrial Park | Krishna Industrial Park | Gokul Industrial Estate | Fortune Industrial Park | Halol GIDC | Kalol GIDC | Baska Industrial Area | Tajpura Industrial Area.\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <section class=\"my-16\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold section-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">1. What is covered under the Annual Maintenance Contract?</h5>\n                <p>Our AMC includes periodic preventive maintenance, filter cleaning, gas pressure checks, electrical component inspections, and priority breakdown assistance.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">2. Do you provide services outside Vadodara?</h5>\n                <p>Yes, we provide <b>Annual Maintenance Contract</b> services across Gujarat, including Halol, Savli, Padra, and Bharuch for industrial clients.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">3. Are spare parts included in the AMC cost?</h5>\n                <p>We offer both &#8220;Service Only&#8221; and &#8220;Comprehensive&#8221; AMC plans. Comprehensive plans include major spares, while Service Only plans charge for parts separately.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">4. How often are the maintenance visits?</h5>\n                <p>Typically, we provide 3 to 4 visits per year depending on the plan you choose—usually 2 dry services and 2 wet services.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">5. Do you service industrial chillers?</h5>\n                <p>Yes, we are experts in <b>chiller repair services Vadodara</b> and provide full AMC for process chillers in GIDC areas.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">6. Can I get an AMC for an old AC unit?</h5>\n                <p>Yes, we provide AMC for older units after a preliminary inspection to ensure the machine is in workable condition.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">7. What happens if my AC breaks down between services?</h5>\n                <p>AMC customers receive priority &#8220;Same-Day&#8221; service for any emergency breakdowns during the contract period.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">8. Do you use genuine spares for brands like Daikin and LG?</h5>\n                <p>Yes, we source high-quality, genuine spares to ensure the longevity of your equipment, regardless of the brand.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">9. Is panel AC maintenance included for industries?</h5>\n                <p>Absolutely. We have specialized teams for <b>panel AC service Vadodara</b> specifically for CNC and VMC machine cooling.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h5 class=\"font-bold\">10. How do I pay for the AMC?</h5>\n                <p>Payments can be made via bank transfer, UPI, or through our WooCommerce-powered shop page on the website.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<footer class=\"bg-black text-white py-12\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n        <div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4\">Atlas Aircon</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-400\">Your trusted partner for <b>Annual Maintenance Contract</b> and HVAC solutions in Vadodara, Gujarat.</p>\n            <p class=\"mt-4\">Phone: +91 97272 57141</p>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4\">Quick Links</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm space-y-2 text-gray-400\">\n                <li><a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\">AC Service</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\">Chiller Repair</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\">HVAC Service</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/refrigerator-repair-services-vadodara\">Fridge Repair</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4\">Support</h4>\n            <ul class=\"text-sm space-y-2 text-gray-400\">\n                <li><a href=\"/privacy-policy/\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/ac-technician-jobs\">Careers</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/blogs\">Latest Updates</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/contact-us\">Help Center</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-4\">Address</h4>\n        